# --- fingerprinting final-release artifact ---
# superseded scripts/data and exploratory dirs kept on disk for provenance, not committed
evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/archive/
evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/log*
evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/candidates_*/
evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/model_*/
evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/model/
