# full confirmed-probe working set is bulky/regenerable (mine_probes.py recreates it)
evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/reference/*/probes_full/
# ...but DO commit the few decision-tree probe traces the deployment model replays
# (overrides the global *.trace ignore above; last-matching rule wins)
!evaluation-ddyf/fingerprinting/reference/*/probes/*.trace
